{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-createcolumnhelper","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: createColumnHelper()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function createColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>(): ColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/columnHelper.ts#L99","children":[{"type":"text","value":"helpers/columnHelper.ts:99"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates helper functions for authoring column definitions with stronger value\ninference."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"accessor"},{"type":"text","value":" infers "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":" from an accessor key or accessor function,\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"display"},{"type":"text","value":" creates non-data columns, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"group"},{"type":"text","value":" creates parent columns, and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columns"},{"type":"text","value":" preserves tuple-level value types for arrays. At runtime these\nhelpers only return column definition objects."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/RowData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/ColumnHelper.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ColumnHelper"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const helper = createColumnHelper<typeof features, Person>() // features is the result of `tableFeatures({})` helper\nconst columns = [\n helper.display({ id: 'actions', header: 'Actions' }),\n helper.accessor('firstName', {}),\n helper.accessor((row) => row.lastName, { id: 'lastName' }),\n]","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-createcolumnhelper","text":"Function: createColumnHelper()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: createColumnHelper()\n\n```ts\nfunction createColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>(): ColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/columnHelper.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/columnHelper.ts#L99)\n\nCreates helper functions for authoring column definitions with stronger value\ninference.\n\n`accessor` infers `TValue` from an accessor key or accessor function,\n`display` creates non-data columns, `group` creates parent columns, and\n`columns` preserves tuple-level value types for arrays. At runtime these\nhelpers only return column definition objects.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ColumnHelper`](../interfaces/ColumnHelper.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst helper = createColumnHelper<typeof features, Person>() // features is the result of `tableFeatures({})` helper\nconst columns = [\n helper.display({ id: 'actions', header: 'Actions' }),\n helper.accessor('firstName', {}),\n helper.accessor((row) => row.lastName, { id: 'lastName' }),\n]\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createColumnHelper\ntitle: createColumnHelper\n---\n\n# Function: createColumnHelper()\n\n```ts\nfunction createColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>(): ColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/columnHelper.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/columnHelper.ts#L99)\n\nCreates helper functions for authoring column definitions with stronger value\ninference.\n\n`accessor` infers `TValue` from an accessor key or accessor function,\n`display` creates non-data columns, `group` creates parent columns, and\n`columns` preserves tuple-level value types for arrays. At runtime these\nhelpers only return column definition objects.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ColumnHelper`](../interfaces/ColumnHelper.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst helper = createColumnHelper<typeof features, Person>() // features is the result of `tableFeatures({})` helper\nconst columns = [\n helper.display({ id: 'actions', header: 'Actions' }),\n helper.accessor('firstName', {}),\n helper.accessor((row) => row.lastName, { id: 'lastName' }),\n]\n```\n"}
